			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>c03群集用
・swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T03:19:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T05:26:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CROWD_MSG13"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しごとは　たのしまないと
じんせいが　つまらなくなるよ！▼
だって　いちにちの　うち
しごとの　じかんは　ながいもん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T03:18:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>仕事は　楽しまないと
人生が　いろあせるよ！▼
だって　一日の　うち
大半は　仕事してるんだからさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T03:18:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>c03群集用
・swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T03:18:54" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T05:26:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CROWD_MSG14"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケウッドに　あそびに　いきたいな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
