	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CROWD_MSG15"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジムリーダーの　アーティさんと
ポケモンしょうぶ　したかい？▼
あのひと　つかみどころが　ないが
ポケモンのこと　だいすき　だよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジムリーダーの　アーティさんと
ポケモン勝負　したかい？▼
あの人　つかみどころが　ないが
ポケモンのこと　大好き　だよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T12:59:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>c03群集用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T03:09:27" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T05:26:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CROWD_MSG16"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひさびさに　ポケモンと
たびを　したけど　よかったよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T03:09:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>久々に　ポケモンと
旅を　したけど　よかったよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T03:09:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
